    <h3>What Is the Snake Game?</h3>

    <p>
      The <strong>snake game</strong> is a single-player arcade puzzle where you control a growing line
      of segments across a grid. Collect every food item that appears while avoiding the edges and your
      own body. Each meal makes the snake longer, so every turn gets a little riskier. The game ends
      when you run out of space to maneuver — and that tight-corner tension is exactly what has kept
      players coming back since the first version hit arcade screens.
    </p>

