    <h3>How to Play the Classic Snake Game</h3>

    <p>
      Getting started takes seconds. Use the arrow keys, W A S D, a swipe, or the on-screen direction
      pad to steer your hungry snake toward the fruit. Collecting a fruit grows your snake by one
      segment and increases your score. The catch? The board stays the same size while you keep growing,
      so the <strong>classic snake game</strong> becomes a game of patience and precision. Move with
      intention, leave yourself an escape route, and never reverse into your own body.
    </p>

